# A decorator refers to a void attribute.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ∅, φ ↦ ξ.x ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 a foo
F c1 x φ
D c2 c1 x
P c1 φ c2
P c0 a c1
D c3 c0 a
P c0 foo c3
